# VeriVote keeps frontend and backend configuration separate.
#
#   frontend/.env.example  ->  copy to frontend/.env.local
#   backend/.env.example   ->  copy to backend/.env
#
# frontend/.env.local is shipped to the browser. It must never contain the
# database URL, the Supabase service-role key, or the JWT secret.
# Those belong only in backend/.env.
